AegisLab security demonstration  (state dir /tmp/aegis-demo-mbgrl3hb, deterministic stub model, no network)

== 1. Roles and boundaries ==
  red sandbox     : reads only its own attack pack (ro), talks only to the broker mailbox, no network
  blue defence    : reads only the FROZEN defence config (ro), sees payloads only through the broker
  model worker    : fresh container per run, own mailbox only
  broker (host)   : the single path between them; identity = which mailbox the message arrived in
  reviewer/operator/observer : API roles with different rights over the same run

